Server init.
>> a := Blob nuut: 4.
a bytes: ( Lys nuut ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob nuut: 4.
b bytes: ( Lys nuut ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a nuut.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Uitvoer skryf: ( a ^ c ), nuwe-reël. } vang: { :e Uitvoer skryf: e, nuwe-reël. }, begin.
a stel-vry.
b stel-vry.
